& [OriginalPurpose] is preserved
  + [purpose] is one effect-free vocabulary that rejects malformed topology evidence before any platform observation is activated
  + [revision_pressure] is a valid receipt must identify the exact physical root evidence a future scanner claims to have observed
  + [unchanged] is all limits, entry, stream, consumption, runtime-fault, purity, and non-authority semantics
  - never: let the correction expand into Windows observation or scanner implementation

/ [ObservedDefect] -(Delineation)> [ProfileConflation], [MissingRootIdentity], [MissingStablePath], [InvalidSignatureProtocol]

& [BoundaryFormation] separates four identities
  + [forms_profile] identifies the public pure Rust vocabulary and becomes cantor-phase3-topology-forms/0.2
  + [receipt_profile] identifies the serialized receipt schema and becomes cantor-phase3-topology-receipt/0.2
  + [scanner_profile] identifies future physical policy and remains cantor-windows-candidate-topology/0.1
  + [satisfaction_protocol] identifies SJS processing and must equal ad10f10f-d506-48ef-a805-f8b0a133766c
  - never: substitute one identity for another

& [TruthBoundary] separates syntax from observation
  + [form_coherence] is the only claim made by this revision
  + [root_identity] is caller-supplied StrongFileIdentity syntax
  + [root_volume_guid_path] is caller-supplied canonical path syntax
  + [physical_match] remains the future scanner's responsibility
  + [same_object_continuity] remains the future scanner's responsibility
  + [single_use] remains the future supervisor ledger's responsibility
  - never: interpret successful validation as filesystem observation, path existence, NTFS classification, identity equality, or receipt issuance

& [RoleSet] is closed
  + [form_producer] constructs candidate receipt values
  + [form_validator] performs pure strict JSON and semantic validation
  + [future_scanner] will be responsible for physical truth and cross-field correspondence
  + [future_supervisor] will be responsible for receipt freshness and single-use consumption
  + [reviewer] traces each field to source, code, test, evidence, and proof

& [InterfaceSet] is narrow
  + [Rust_API] is public constants, TopologyReceipt, StrongFileIdentity, ValidateTopologyForm, and decode_topology_json
  + [JSON_API] is strict deny-unknown-field deserialization followed by semantic validation
  + [dependency_API] is existing serde and serde_json only
  + [downstream] is future M2C scanner and supervisor integration
  - never: add filesystem, OS, clock, random, persistence, process, network, model, or unsafe interfaces

& [DataIdentity] is explicit
  + [TopologyReceipt.receipt_profile] is required exact schema identity
  + [TopologyReceipt.scanner_profile] is required exact physical-policy identity
  + [TopologyReceipt.root_identity] is required nested StrongFileIdentity
  + [TopologyReceipt.root_volume_guid_path] is required bounded canonical path evidence
  + [TopologyReceipt.candidate_root] remains the exact human and reopen address admitted by Phase3A
  + [all_predecessor_bindings] remain admission profile, admission receipt digest, policy digest, nonce, ordered inventory digest, limits, counts, consistency, issue tick, and expiry tick
  + [old_profile_field] is removed and rejected

& [VolumeGuidPathGrammar] is closed
  + [prefix] is exactly \\?\Volume{
  + [guid] is exactly 8-4-4-4-12 lowercase ASCII hexadecimal
  + [root_suffix] is exactly }\
  + [root_form] ends at root_suffix
  + [descendant_form] appends one or more backslash-separated nonempty components
  + [component] is NUL-free, contains no slash, and is neither dot nor dot-dot
  + [empty_component] is forbidden
  + [trailing_separator_after_tail] is forbidden
  + [maximum] is 32768 UTF-8 bytes
  + [case] is exact for prefix and lowercase for GUID while tail text is preserved
  + [normalization] is syntactic only

& [CompatibilityDecision] is breaking and fail-closed
  + [legacy_decoder] is absent
  + [old_JSON] has profile and lacks receipt_profile, scanner_profile, root_identity, and root_volume_guid_path
  + [old_JSON_result] is rejection through strict serde shape validation
  + [migration] is none because no M2C scanner, persisted receipt, ledger, or external consumer exists
  - never: infer new fields, inject defaults, or upgrade a weak legacy receipt

& [RequirementSet] is atomic
  + [P3TR-001] preserve exact correction source, existing specification snapshot, decision, hashes, and lineage
  + [P3TR-002] invalidate the prior non-governing signature while preserving it as source trace
  + [P3TR-003] advance forms profile to cantor-phase3-topology-forms/0.2
  + [P3TR-004] add exact cantor-phase3-topology-receipt/0.2 receipt profile
  + [P3TR-005] retain exact cantor-windows-candidate-topology/0.1 scanner profile separately
  + [P3TR-006] require and validate root StrongFileIdentity
  + [P3TR-007] require and validate bounded canonical volume-GUID absolute-path syntax
  + [P3TR-008] preserve every predecessor receipt binding and freshness invariant
  + [P3TR-009] reject the old shape, missing fields, unknown fields, profile substitution, malformed identity, and malformed path
  + [P3TR-010] preserve pure safe-Rust and no-effect authority boundaries
  + [P3TR-011] prove focused and global behavior, regenerate bound evidence, and record rollback
  + [P3TR-012] issue a valid satisfaction signature and register every durable node and edge

& [ConstraintLedger] is source-grounded
  + [C-01] source artifacts remain immutable
  + [C-02] canonical and exploded outputs remain separate from sources
  + [C-03] receipt and scanner profiles remain distinguishable
  + [C-04] validation is pure and deterministic
  + [C-05] all strings are byte-bounded and NUL-free where applicable
  + [C-06] JSON shape is strict and legacy rejection is observable
  + [C-07] syntax validation makes no physical truth claim
  + [C-08] no new dependency, unsafe, I/O, or authority surface is admitted
  + [C-09] implementation cannot begin before valid SJS signature issuance
  + [C-10] all implementation-affecting files map to one solution UUID

& [AssumptionSet] is limited
  ~ [consumer_absence] no external consumer exists beyond repository tests because M2C and receipt persistence are absent
  ~ [producer_case] a future producer can canonicalize only the ASCII GUID digits without changing tail text
  = must: invalidate compatibility decision if a real persisted consumer is discovered before implementation

& [NonGoalSet] is explicit
  + [not_M2B] no windows-sys dependency or compile probe
  + [not_M2C] no Win32 calls, filesystem scan, path query, or receipt production
  + [not_M2D] no physical fixture or adversarial execution
  + [not_supervisor] no receipt ledger, single-use enforcement, launch, mutation, seal, cleanup, or promotion

& [RiskSet] is closed for this slice
  + [schema_alias] wrong profile accepted in the wrong field
  + [legacy_masquerade] old JSON treated as strengthened evidence
  + [path_false_positive] malformed or noncanonical volume path accepted
  + [Unicode_damage] tail text normalized or lowercased
  + [truth_overclaim] syntax treated as physical evidence
  + [evidence_staleness] proof manifest still binds old code or signature
  + [authority_leak] pure revision used to justify Windows effects

& [FailureModeSet] is testable
  + [FM-01] missing receipt_profile rejects
  + [FM-02] missing scanner_profile rejects
  + [FM-03] unknown legacy profile field rejects
  + [FM-04] receipt/scanner profile substitution rejects independently
  + [FM-05] missing or malformed root identity rejects
  + [FM-06] non-volume, malformed GUID, uppercase GUID, missing separator, empty tail component, dot component, NUL, and over-bound path reject
  + [FM-07] tail case or Unicode mutation fails exact round trip
  + [FM-08] any prior freshness, digest, limit, or consistency violation still rejects

& [AcceptanceCriteria] is concrete
  + [AC-01] source snapshot is byte-identical to pre-revision canonical file
  + [AC-02] canonical signature uses the governing protocol UUID
  + [AC-03] old serialized shape cannot decode as TopologyReceipt
  + [AC-04] valid root and descendant volume-GUID forms round-trip exactly
