  + [AC-06] formatting, lint, debug, overflow-checked release, release build, rustdoc, and dependency audit pass
  + [AC-07] evidence manifest binds new source, canonical, exploded, justification, plan, matrix, solution, proof, and code
  + [AC-08] no forbidden import, dependency, unsafe, or side effect is introduced

& [VerificationPlan] is ordered
  + [V-01] byte-compare snapshot and source hashes
  + [V-02] inspect the public serialized field set
  + [V-03] run focused topology_forms tests
  + [V-04] run source/API purity and legacy-shape tests
  + [V-05] run full debug and overflow-checked release workspaces
