  + [benefit] no weak evidence path survives
  + [cost] source-compatible Rust construction and JSON compatibility break
  + [mitigation] no production consumer exists and compiler/test failures expose every internal construction site
  + [rejected] named legacy decoder because it creates permanent weak-evidence surface without migration value

& [ConstraintCheckTrace] is passed
  + [grounding] correction source, exact prior snapshot, pre-SJS decision, root reconciliation research, and governing SJS protocol
  + [conflict] prior signature claimed valid under a different protocol UUID
  + [repair] preserve the prior file, mark its signature invalidated in lineage, and issue a new governing signature
