& [SemanticRefinementTrace] is explicit
  + [profile] changed from one overloaded profile field to forms, receipt, scanner, and SJS protocol identities
  + [root] changed from a human address alone to human address plus strong identity plus stable namespace evidence
  + [validation] narrowed from generic bounded text to one closed volume-GUID grammar
  + [compatibility] changed from unspecified to explicit rejection without migration
